<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Quickco renews cautionary notice.</title>
<headline>Quickco renews cautionary notice.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quick Holdings Ltd on Wednesday renewed a cautionary notice to shareholders after announcing on April 23 that it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings but gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
